<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10238" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιπαθ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in return for suffering,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				782
			</span></i>; <i>felt mutually,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of opposite feelings</i> or <i>properties,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.664c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσιν ἔχειν ἀ. πρός τι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				940a
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					5.11.4
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				8.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in Metric, of
				<i>opposed</i> rhythms, Sch. Heph.<i><span class="en">
				p.122C.
			</span></i>,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιπαθές, τό,</span>
			<i>remedy for suffering,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				45
			</span></i>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίτομον: φάρμακον
				ἀντιπαθές,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθος ἀντιπαθὴς
			καλούμενος</span> Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Fluv.</u>
				21.5
			</span></i>:—name of a <i>black kind of coral,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.122
			</span></i>.</div>
